{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj5CM13u89m4zwK46XJS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I am locked.\n\nA heavy, iron-banded oak door. Cold to the touch. The keyhole stares at you like a single dark eye, waiting.\n\nNo key, no passage.\n\nPresent a key."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":50,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}